But as soon as I started playing this game, I said, wait a minute.

00:30:05.160 --> 00:30:06.240
I've done this before.

00:30:06.380 --> 00:30:08.520
Like, are we sure that we haven't played this one?

00:30:08.580 --> 00:30:10.800
And I looked into it, and I said, oh, okay, okay, okay.

00:30:11.040 --> 00:30:12.600
So I actually went back and played Legend of Kage.

00:30:13.680 --> 00:30:16.580
And, you know, this is the prettier version of that game.

00:30:16.660 --> 00:30:18.700
And I had a little more fun with that version.

00:30:19.040 --> 00:30:21.680
So I'm not even going to say Demon Sword's, like, that much of an upgrade.

00:30:22.460 --> 00:30:25.960
It's a perplexing upgrade, if anything, because, yeah, it's adding stuff.

00:30:25.960 --> 00:30:28.760
But is it really adding any fun?

00:30:29.220 --> 00:30:30.480
No, not for me.

00:30:31.020 --> 00:30:33.320
Sean? I will agree with you.

00:30:33.520 --> 00:30:35.920
This is a very pretty game.

00:30:36.340 --> 00:30:38.820
We didn't really talk too much about that.

00:30:38.820 --> 00:30:45.860
But, again, we basically come to the conclusion that this is a tech demo, even though we were joking about it.

00:30:45.980 --> 00:30:50.800
Like, if we're going to get a third of the content, I'm not calling this a full game.

00:30:51.780 --> 00:30:59.720
And even when it's, like, full of content, I'm not entirely sure if it, like, fits its own design doc.

00:30:59.720 --> 00:31:04.240
So I would say that this also is not essential.

00:31:04.600 --> 00:31:08.460
Joe? Yeah, I mean, you mentioned how we, like, barely talked about the game this episode.

00:31:08.460 --> 00:31:09.480
And that feels weird.

00:31:09.480 --> 00:31:16.700
But it's just, like, you run around, you attack enemies, you fight bosses.

00:31:17.600 --> 00:31:21.380
And I feel like everything around that is so not memorable.

00:31:21.760 --> 00:31:23.200
Like, it's hard to talk about this game.

00:31:23.340 --> 00:31:26.620
Like, what? It's just, like, that's kind of the meat and potatoes of it.

00:31:26.620 --> 00:31:30.000
And I feel like this is one of the many.

00:31:30.200 --> 00:31:34.960
But, like, maybe one that's, like, very guilty of feeling unfinished.

00:31:35.460 --> 00:31:38.000
So definitely not essential on my part.

